a-rid="03f59299-a3ad-492d-8113-93b8e19ad40f" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0.0.0.0.0" class="r-1v8ekh4"><div data-rid="4d855516-4af8-43a3-a40c-242a7f61f782" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0.0.0.0.0.0" class="r-953rmx"><div class="r-u4skki"><video style="width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:var(--rof, inherit);object-position:var(--rop, inherit)" preload="metadata" autoplay="" muted="" loop=""></video></div></div></div><div data-rid="aaac3306-a7f3-40df-809b-28349fb27240" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0.0.0.0.0" class="r-y0m6b3"><div data-rid="3cb90ea7-e354-4516-981a-0a039631e15e" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0.0.0.0.0.0" class="r-kj6zvf alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Supercharge your workout</p></span></div><div data-rid="37ba3e17-12e0-4899-aed2-a83402efd223" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0.0.0.0.0.0" class="r-1ghgpfp alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0)">Creatine is one of the most studied and effective supplements for strength, power, and endurance. Naturally found in your muscles, it fuels short bursts of intense activity—like lifting, sprinting, and jumping.</span></p></span></div><div data-rid="450bbfb5-ff24-47ec-a3c1-8ed0958ca1b3" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0.0.0.0.0.0" class="r-abyu91 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0)">By increasing your muscles’ energy reserves, creatine helps you train harder, recover faster, and build strength more efficiently. It also aids in hydration, reducing muscle fatigue and improving overall performance.</span></p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-state="inactive" data-orientation="vertical" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="radix-:Ra32:-trigger-4ca6b3ea-e7ed-45bc-9753-3295c3097fa31" id="radix-:Ra32:-content-4ca6b3ea-e7ed-45bc-9753-3295c3097fa31" tabindex="0" style="display:none"><div data-rid="46f8aad7-e232-4894-8e18-87b677e19dd7" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0.0.0.0" class="r-1qzslx2"><picture data-rid="18bd0e82-70dd-45de-8cb0-a87618ea0ada" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0.0.0.0.0" class="r-12uhago"><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/71d9e724-94e9-4f37-b93b-4df893219519/d55524c7-ff82-4533-8f42-1e0170f7840a?width=820" media="(max-width: 640px)"/><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/71d9e724-94e9-4f37-b93b-4df893219519/d55524c7-ff82-4533-8f42-1e0170f7840a?width=1024" media="(min-width: 641px) and (max-width: 1024px)"/><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/71d9e724-94e9-4f37-b93b-4df893219519/d55524c7-ff82-4533-8f42-1e0170f7840a?width=1800" media="(min-width: 1025px) and (max-width: 2400px)"/><img src="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/71d9e724-94e9-4f37-b93b-4df893219519/d55524c7-ff82-4533-8f42-1e0170f7840a" alt="Bar graph showing memory performance improvement with creatine in younger and older adults." class="r-17vttcr" loading="eager"/></picture><div data-rid="043ba0d2-05b4-476d-9414-90dcbb4ae44f" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0.0.0.0.0" class="r-niag7z"><div data-rid="f2717974-d13f-4dcb-a597-30a26b42ac0e" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0.0.0.0.0.0" class="r-16rc2qd alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0)">WHY CREATINE BOOSTS YOUR BRAIN</span></p></span></div><div data-rid="9b613c41-6f49-4714-ad55-553e70c19a29" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0.0.0.0.0.0" class="r-2us8g1 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0)">Your brain, like your muscles, relies on energy to function at its best. Creatine helps fuel cognitive processes by increasing ATP production—the brain’s primary energy source.</span></p></span></div><div data-rid="2e3bf34f-7c26-4f17-87b9-6ded5e8fb4d1" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0.0.0.0.0.0" class="r-1drtbcx alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0)">Studies show that creatine supplementation can improve memory, focus, and mental clarity, especially during stress or fatigue. It also supports brain health over time, making it a powerful tool for both mental performance and long-term cognitive function.</span></p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-state="inactive" data-orientation="vertical" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="radix-:Ra32:-trigger-bdcce187-55b9-43ba-b8ba-ce50e8de12672" id="radix-:Ra32:-content-bdcce187-55b9-43ba-b8ba-ce50e8de12672" tabindex="0" style="display:none"><div data-rid="f4bb7f6e-5f89-4cf7-aa5f-eccb19a275aa" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0.0.0.0" class="r-hmuw8t"><picture data-rid="3ec70a75-4da3-448d-98db-a606e6e8f5e3" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0.0.0.0.0" class="r-174g3nk"><source srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0611/9204/4732/files/Image_6_1_49669bd9-d833-4c99-9a8f-c931f4cc88b1.jpg?v=1740955337&amp;width=820" media="(max-width: 640px)"/><source srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0611/9204/4732/files/Image_6_1_49669bd9-d833-4c99-9a8f-c931f4cc88b1.jpg?v=1740955337&amp;width=1024" media="(min-width: 641px) and (max-width: 1024px)"/><source srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0611/9204/4732/files/Image_6_1_49669bd9-d833-4c99-9a8f-c931f4cc88b1.jpg?v=1740955337&amp;width=1800" media="(min-width: 1025px) and (max-width: 2400px)"/><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0611/9204/4732/files/Image_6_1_49669bd9-d833-4c99-9a8f-c931f4cc88b1.jpg?v=1740955337" alt="Benefits of creatine include enhanced energy, recovery, hydration, reduced brain fog, better sleep, lower blood sugar, muscle building." class="r-12lxssg" loading="eager"/></picture><div data-rid="7ef3e18f-e096-487f-99ca-1f73fffead47" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0.0.0.0.0" class="r-18guu1e"><div data-rid="9af0a116-59be-4c7e-b956-6d858ef5ad76" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0.0.0.0.0.0" class="r-1mrhcix alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0)">WHY CREATINE SUPPORTS OVERALL HEALTH</span></p></span></div><div data-rid="60acbc3b-11ad-4bd6-9f51-a5e7d89b0cc1" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0.0.0.0.0.0" class="r-ut77zh alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0)">Creatine isn’t just for workouts—it plays a key role in energy production, muscle preservation, and cellular function. It supports strength, hydration, and recovery while also benefiting brain health, metabolism, and even bone density.</span></p></span></div><div data-rid="746df7b8-aea8-4681-a6c7-b8824dc8167b" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0.0.0.0.0.0" class="r-244bom alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0)">As we age, natural creatine levels decline, making supplementation a simple way to maintain muscle mass, cognitive function, and overall vitality. It’s a small addition with big benefits for lifelong health.</span></p></span></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div data-replo-marquee-root="true" data-rid="d215e887-bd90-47d0-aa1a-90c5d9ea20ac" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0" class="r-jp4se9"><div class="r-72dkn7" data-replo-marquee-track="true"><div data-rid="1c9ad4a2-5a0d-4817-942e-67e07191e58a" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0.0" class="r-cj2irg"><picture data-rid="776d9033-6c1c-4031-bc33-baefd935f156" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0.0.0" class="r-wgu0ep"><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/71d9e724-94e9-4f37-b93b-4df893219519/ef76259e-1861-43a0-a8f4-722b4762cce6?width=820" media="(max-width: 640px)"/><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/71d9e724-94e9-4f37-b93b-4df893219519/ef76259e-1861-43a0-a8f4-722b4762cce6?width=1024" media="(min-width: 641px) and (max-width: 1024px)"/><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/71d9e724-94e9-4f37-b93b-4df893219519/ef76259e-1861-43a0-a8f4-722b4762cce6?width=1800" media="(min-width: 1025px) and (max-width: 2400px)"/><img src="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/71d9e724-94e9-4f37-b93b-4df893219519/ef76259e-1861-43a0-a8f4-722b4762cce6" alt="A silhouette of a man and a woman face to face." class="r-9edon7" loading="lazy"/></picture><picture data-rid="5f89e20f-291d-4e23-9b21-512ed